cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the configurations, programs or results of this repository,
  please cite it as below. The individual papers have their own DOIs
  (concept DOIs, always resolving to the latest version — see README).
title: "saturation: certified computations on the no-three-in-line problem and its relatives"
authors:
  - family-names: Kudriashov
    given-names: Aleksei
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-8885-5338"
abstract: >-
  Working repository of certified computations on the no-three-in-line
  problem (plane and cube) and the no-four-coplanar problem: witness
  configurations, exact values, exhaustive sweeps, and five papers. The
  searches, proofs, programs and texts were produced by autonomous AI
  agents (Anthropic Claude, model Claude Fable 5) under the direction of
  the author of record, who takes responsibility for the content.
repository-code: "https://github.com/iwasborninbali/saturation"
url: "https://github.com/iwasborninbali/saturation"
date-released: "2026-08-23"
